 # Irrigation season:
 #   Inflow values were reduced to 0. Based on seasons/priority as dictated by the decree, the
 #   portion of the decree water not used by crops/ET was applied using the recharge package.
 #   Water in excess of decrees was routed to a return flow location below the irrigation area.
 # Non irrigation season:
 #   All flow is routed through the original gage location(s).
 # Note:
 #   Calculations are time-weighted monthly values and in transition month(s) there may be flow
 #   in the original gage location, recharge package, and return flow location
 #   The g########_base values are the original flow value preserved for posterity.
 #modelday	g10329000	g10329000_base	g10329500	g10329500_base
    TIME-SERIES DATA WILL BE READ FROM FILE: external_files/ts/hrb_sfr6.paradise.return.ts
